162
00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:28.110
<b>30
Silver</b>

163
00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:25.740
Easy. I paid you
30 for the first pot,

164
00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:28.540
so I'll give it back,
and that makes 60.

165
00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.490
<b>30
Silver</b>

166
00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.960
Got it.

167
00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:31.380
Thanks, pal!

168
00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:34.040
What the hell?

169
00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:36.710
He just conned that guy
out of 30 silver!

170
00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:43.250
<b>Denjiro

Orphan in the Capital</b>

171
00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:40.950
Easy money!

172
00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.800
Kin! You scared me!

173
00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:47.310
Look!
I scored me something good.

174
00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:53.970
<b>Kozuki Oden

The Shogun's Heir</b>

175
00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:26.710
Our next drink will be
in the afterlife.

176
00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.600
Take it easy, friend.

177
00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:43.020
Excuse me. I'll be
taking my leave.

178
00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:44.390
But I am sorry for your loss.

179
00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:45.480
Boss?

180
00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:59.450
That was amazing! So cool!

181
00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.660
What did he just do?

182
00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.310
That was one of
his trademark Oden speeches!

183
00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:06.370
to sink you.

184
00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:09.830
Just to be clear,
you came to arrest me?

185
00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:11.290
Well, yes.

186
00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.460
But personally,
I don't want to arrest you,

187
00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.170
so if you could bribe me,
that would help us both.

188
00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.960
Well, this is new.

189
00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.220
Usually it's me people
are running from.

190
00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.800
Eh, there must be a fire,
or something of the sort.

191
00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.840
Are you out of your mind?

192
00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:28.050
You can't bring that thing
into the city!

193
00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.140
You can't bring that
thing into the city!

194
00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:33.520
What? But it's just
a little boar.

195
00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.730
Kurokoma doesn't
want that for business,

196
00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:39.400
he wants to use it as a decoy
to destroy the Hyogoro Family!

197
00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:40.900
What does that mean?

198
00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.240
I mean that thing's
parent will come for it!

199
00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.910
We'll have a giant boar charging
through town any second now!

200
00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:51.410
Ko...

201
00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.120
Kozuki Oden!

202
00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.970
What do you mean, its parent?

203
00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.470
According to ancient documents,

204
00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.740
it's white, and strong,
and big as a mountain!

205
00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:08.570
Why do you think everyone
calls it the Mountain God?

206
00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:10.100
What?

207
00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.400
They say that
several hundred years ago,

208
00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.230
it destroyed an entire
village in one night.

209
00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:16.440
That sounded crazy,

210
00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.100
so I figured it was
just a legend.

211
00:11:18.100 --> 00:11:19.240
Cool it! You're our hostage now!

212
00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:22.400
But now, there's
a white boar here,

213
00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.160
right in front of our eyes!

214
00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.320
So that must mean...

215
00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:28.620
The Mountain God is real!

216
00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.040
It's come to swallow us alive!

217
00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.000
It's already upon us!
Run for it!

218
00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.370
It's all my fault!

219
00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:47.390
The capital's doomed
and it's my fault!

220
00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.520
Kin!

221
00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:20.460
Pardon me, I couldn't help but
overhear what you just said.

222
00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:23.840
Pardon me, but I couldn't help
but overhear what you just said.

223
00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.520
I don't need to know how
you came upon that boar,

224
00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:28.350
Why don't you hand that boar
over to me and I'll settle this?

225
00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:33.190
but why don't you hand it over
to me and I'll settle this?

226
00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.000
Well, thanks a lot,
you little porkchop!

227
00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:55.460
Now we're all gonna die!
Stop squealing!

228
00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:58.080
I told you, just give
that thing to me!

229
00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.670
Now, hold on a sec!

230
00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.710
You can't take this from me,
I'm gonna sell it and get rich!

231
00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:03.260
So hands off!

232
00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.050
I've got a mountain of debts
I need to pay off right away!

233
00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:06.720
Then I'll use the rest
on investments

234
00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.260
to get even more rich!

235
00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.560
It's really him! Kozuki Oden!

236
00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.810
Adults are nothing
but a bunch of clowns.

237
00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:18.400
But this man?
This man alone, I respect!

238
00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.820
Its child is here.

239
00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.120
That's the only reason why
the Mountain God would

240
00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:28.940
come to a place
where humans dwell!

241
00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:29.740
It's a nightmare!

242
00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:33.040
You mean some idiot stole
its child and brought it here?

243
00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.960
We must placate
the Mountain God and quickly!

244
00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:38.460
There should be a white piglet
somewhere close by!

245
00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:41.540
If we can't send it back to
the mountain where it belongs,

246
00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.340
the capital will crumble!

247
00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.280
So there you are!
Finally found you!

248
00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.360
This is all your fault,
you boar thief!

249
00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.780
Who's the
boar thief, you boar thief?!

250
00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:19.450
Send that thing back to the
mountain before we're dead!

251
00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:19.660
You know what'll happen

252
00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.540
You know what'll happen when
the big one gets a whiff of it?

253
00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.290
when the big one
gets a whiff of it?

254
00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.910
We're done for.

255
00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:25.540
What?

256
00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:27.290
We had no idea
this was gonna happen

257
00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:28.790
when we took that piglet.

258
00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:32.130
My two buddies got eaten up
by the Mountain God already!

259
00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.670
Their clothes smelled
like its baby, y'see!

260
00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.840
And then it swallowed
your friend Otsuru, too!

261
00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:38.930
Wait, Tsuru was there?

262
00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.850
We needed a plan to get that
white boar back from you.

263
00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.680
So we took Otsuru as a hostage.

264
00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:45.890
But then,
on the way to the city...

265
00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:49.730
It came outta nowhere
and ate them!

266
00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:52.190
They're dead and
it's all your fault!

267
00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:00.360
– Hey, wait!

268
00:15:22.970 --> 00:15:25.890
Here it comes!

269
00:15:36.920 --> 00:15:39.630
What? Kin stole something again?

270
00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:43.090
I'm so sorry!
Please let me pay for it!

271
00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:48.110
Kin, it's time
you get a real job!

272
00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:50.650
You can't keep angering
the yakuza like this!

273
00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:52.280
They're going to kill you!

274
00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:55.910
So what? Not like
anyone's gonna care if I die!

275
00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.790
Did you just
hit me with a rock?

276
00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:07.000
Give her back right now!

277
00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:47.460
Stop it, you fool!

278
00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:48.670
If you harm the Mountain God,

279
00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:50.800
then the Land of Wano
will pay the price!

280
00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.720
I'll cut you open.

281
00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:56.590
Tear through your belly,
and I'll take Tsuru back!

282
00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:59.760
I don't care if you're a god!

283
00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.680
C'mon, Kin, get out of there!

284
00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:24.010
I must admit,
that fellow has guts!

285
00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.780
If Tsuru dies because of me...

286
00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.750
...then I want to die, too!

287
00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.040
So it was you!
I should've known!

288
00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:30.130
Kozuki Oden!
The prodigal son, at it again!

289
00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:32.380
You'll make a fine hotpot.

290
00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.890
This is the last straw.
How could you do this?

291
00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:38.800
My mother was eaten alive!

292
00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:39.890
Take this!

293
00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.270
No. You don't understand!

294
00:18:42.270 --> 00:18:44.440
My daughter is dead!

295
00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.810
I brought that boar here!

296
00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:50.110
It's my fault that
the capital is ruined!

297
00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.860
Your loved ones are
dead because of me!

298
00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:08.000
Oden Two-Sword Style!

299
00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:38.370
<b>Halcyon</b>

300
00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:38.620
<b>Halcyon Falls</b>

301
00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.660
Paradise Waterfall!

302
00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.330
What?!

303
00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:55.510
He's really something!
Let's pack it up.

304
00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:04.030
They say that
the people and houses

305
00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.400
swallowed that day
were so great in number

306
00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.160
that they could have
formed a new town

307
00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.200
in the boar's stomach.

308
00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.870
A quarter of the capital
was destroyed,

309
00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:16.350
but miraculously, not a single
one of its citizens died.

310
00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:18.730
That was horrible!

311
00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:28.620
Oden was amazing.

312
00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.750
I almost
cheered for him back there.

313
00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:34.630
I wish I could
say thank you! But I can't!

314
00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:35.790
You saved us,

315
00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.880
but you're the one
who started this mess!

316
00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:42.820
Everyone, please listen!
It wasn't Oden's fault, it was...

317
00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.690
Don't do anything unnecessary.

318
00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:49.280
Lord Oden, sir!

319
00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:49.520
<b>Notice</b>
<b>of</b>
<b>Disownment</b>

320
00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:53.020
<b>Notice
 of
 Disownment</b>

321
00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:53.630
I'm sorry to give this to you
at a time of such revelry.

322
00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:50.060
<b>Notice
 
 Disownment</b>

323
00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:57.150
<b>Notice
 of
 Disownment</b>

324
00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:55.380
Disavowed, am I?

325
00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:57.800
And expelled from
the capital, too!

326
00:20:57.270 --> 00:21:00.860
<b>Notice 
of 
Disownment</b>

327
00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:01.380
Laughable, Shogun.
Truly pathetic.

328
00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:04.260
So much power,
and I'm still too much for you!

329
00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:08.020
The capital cannot
contain my greatness!

330
00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:11.140
Fine, then! I leave at once!

331
00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:14.320
Wherever the sun falls
is where I shall sleep!

332
00:21:14.320 --> 00:21:16.980
And now, I'm hungry!

333
00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:18.530
The Mountain God incident

334
00:21:18.530 --> 00:21:20.400
marked a new beginning for Oden,

335
00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:23.070
who was still quite
young at the time.

336
00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:26.700
What's the matter? Don't cry!

337
00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.750
I'm not crying at all!

338
00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:32.120
Listen. I would die
for that man, Otsuru!

339
00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:33.380
Um, okay?

340
00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:36.460
Well said! I would die
for Lord Oden, too!

341
00:21:36.460 --> 00:21:38.380
Hey! Denjiro, wait!

342
00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:39.720
What?

343
00:21:39.720 --> 00:21:42.800
Kozuki Oden,
Kozuki Oden, Kozuki Oden!

344
00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:44.600
That man is one of a kind!

345
00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:48.350
Indeed! And I'll follow him
for the rest of my life!

346
00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.520
I was his fan first!

347
00:21:50.520 --> 00:21:52.600
Yeah, well, I'm his biggest fan!

348
00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:53.640
And his first follower!

349
00:21:55.060 --> 00:21:57.650
I wish I was free like them!

350
00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:00.110
All the men who
watched these events transpire

351
00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.950
took a hesitant step forward,

352
00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:04.070
wishing that they could
go along with Oden.

353
00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:08.330
And thus, the capital tilted,
ever so slightly.

354
00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:14.350
<b>Hakumai</b>

355
00:22:11.290 --> 00:22:13.290
What an honor
to see you, Lord Oden!

356
00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:14.920
Please. Come right in!

357
00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:18.040
Lord Yasuie's been
looking forward to your arrival.

358
00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:20.670
Don't lie! I know he hasn't!

359
00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:25.530
<b>Shimotsuki Yasuie

Daimyo of Hakumai</b>

360
00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:23.130
That's right, you idiot.

361
00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:26.140
Who would look forward
to a visit from you?

362
00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:27.970
What is this, your entourage?

363
00:22:27.970 --> 00:22:29.470
What do you miscreants want?

364
00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:31.020
Hey, Uncle!

365
00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:32.680
Oh, don't speak to me like that.

366
00:22:33.940 --> 00:22:36.440
Oh, wait!
There is a puddle of mud!

367
00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:39.820
Please proceed!

368
00:22:39.820 --> 00:22:41.610
Better to walk across my back!

369
00:22:41.610 --> 00:22:43.530
Don't sully yourself!

370
00:22:44.490 --> 00:22:46.700
Who is this guy?
He creeps me out!

371
00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:49.780
He's my new manservant,
and you'd best leave him alone.

372
00:22:49.780 --> 00:22:54.290
Ah, yes, Lord Yasuie
was very kind to take me in.

373
00:22:53.230 --> 00:22:57.690
<b>Kurozumi Orochi</b>

374
00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:58.080
Pleasure to meet you.
I'm Kurozumi Orochi.
